# The vendored FLAC tree must stay byte-identical to upstream-downloads/flac-1.5.0.tar.xz on every
# commit and every checkout. The repository root sets "* text=auto eol=lf", which would normalise
# the three CRLF files of the tarball (flac/test/cuesheets/good.00{2,4,5}*.cue - CRLF on purpose,
# they test DOS-format cue sheets) at `git add`. -text switches every conversion off for the tree.
flac/** -text
# The licence text shipped beside every native binary must be byte-identical on all nine RIDs,
# whichever OS checked the repository out and ran the build. Never convert its line endings.
licenses/LICENSE-Flac.txt -text
# Shell scripts must keep LF to run (Windows checkouts included).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.env text eol=lf
